WEBVTT

00:00:10.340 --> 00:00:15.360
"I can't overcome it"  "I'm annoyed"

00:00:16.010 --> 00:00:20.100
Even if I break down those hurdles

00:00:20.100 --> 00:00:28.310
No answer emerges

00:00:28.310 --> 00:00:34.810
Am I being controlled?  Everyone on the field

00:00:34.810 --> 00:00:39.750
Isn't scared, go away, but...

00:00:39.750 --> 00:00:43.450
The unseen road to the future

00:00:43.450 --> 00:00:51.200
Cannot be chosen

00:00:51.550 --> 00:00:54.500
Close your eyes and cut with your heart

00:00:54.500 --> 00:00:58.160
just like cards, surely

00:00:58.160 --> 00:01:03.230
It was promised  yes!  you are the winner

00:01:03.230 --> 00:01:06.100
never lose!  Cut with your heart

00:01:06.100 --> 00:01:09.330
just like cards, surely

00:01:09.330 --> 00:01:16.680
Because a miracle will occur

00:01:23.200 --> 00:01:24.060
Here I go!

00:01:24.060 --> 00:01:27.000
Alligator's Sword, attack Kuriboh!

00:01:29.940 --> 00:01:31.700
I flip over my set card!

00:01:34.280 --> 00:01:35.660
A trap card!

00:01:35.660 --> 00:01:39.160
Spellbinding Circle protects Kuriboh!

00:01:41.200 --> 00:01:45.660
So what?  I don't care what happens to my monster.

00:01:45.660 --> 00:01:48.860
I only care about eliminating your life points!

00:01:50.130 --> 00:01:53.500
Take this again!

00:01:55.660 --> 00:01:57.500
Hinotama!

00:02:03.570 --> 00:02:09.570
Reach Him!
Red-Eyes B. Dragon of Friendship

00:02:10.820 --> 00:02:13.250
No!  Yugi!

00:02:15.320 --> 00:02:19.320
Forbidden cards have increased my deck's firepower to the max!

00:02:19.480 --> 00:02:22.120
So I don't need monsters!

00:02:23.720 --> 00:02:25.080
Jonouchi...

00:02:26.320 --> 00:02:30.500
As a duelist, doesn't this hurt your heart?

00:02:31.680 --> 00:02:34.930
Heart of a duelist?  I don't care!

00:02:36.400 --> 00:02:41.610
I'm not feeling pain because your card burned me.

00:02:42.930 --> 00:02:47.050
I'm feeling pain because I'm sad that you lost the heart of a duelist!

00:02:52.850 --> 00:02:55.600
Nothing you say will work.

00:02:55.850 --> 00:02:59.220
I implanted a thirst for revenge into his memories.

00:02:59.400 --> 00:03:04.600
Jonouchi is my puppet, and he wants to kill you.

00:03:06.000 --> 00:03:09.170
Yugi, I will crush you.

00:03:09.800 --> 00:03:10.840
Jonouchi...

00:03:11.110 --> 00:03:12.770
It's your turn!

00:03:13.430 --> 00:03:18.370
What can I do to get Jonouchi back to normal?

00:03:18.540 --> 00:03:21.220
Jonouchi, wake up!

00:03:22.400 --> 00:03:24.400
My other self...

00:03:28.250 --> 00:03:29.340
Partner?

00:03:29.340 --> 00:03:33.520
I've never felt you suffer this much before.

00:03:33.520 --> 00:03:33.930
Yeah.

00:03:34.190 --> 00:03:37.360
I may be able to ease your suffering.

00:03:37.960 --> 00:03:39.800
I have a favor to ask.

00:03:40.320 --> 00:03:43.120
I'll fight Jonouchi.

00:03:43.320 --> 00:03:44.240
Partner?

00:03:44.380 --> 00:03:49.170
Back when I was a coward, Jonouchi said I was his friend.

00:03:50.000 --> 00:03:54.600
Jonouchi risked his life to save me from a fire.

00:03:55.200 --> 00:03:58.700
Jonouchi has always saved me.

00:03:59.600 --> 00:04:01.220
It's my turn to save him!

00:04:01.570 --> 00:04:04.160
But this duel is dangerous.

00:04:04.510 --> 00:04:05.800
I know.

00:04:06.050 --> 00:04:14.450
But you told me that I was able to make friends due to my own strength, not the Millennium Puzzle.

00:04:14.450 --> 00:04:15.100
Yes.

00:04:15.420 --> 00:04:18.400
I want to prove that in this duel.

00:04:19.710 --> 00:04:23.310
If I can turn Jonouchi back to normal...

00:04:24.400 --> 00:04:30.010
I can proudly say that I accomplished it on my own.

00:04:30.540 --> 00:04:31.740
Partner...

00:04:34.970 --> 00:04:35.820
Okay.

00:04:36.110 --> 00:04:41.220
But if I sense that your life is in danger, I'm taking over immediately.

00:04:41.220 --> 00:04:41.830
Okay.

00:04:47.480 --> 00:04:49.570
Jonouchi, I'll take you on.

00:04:50.320 --> 00:04:51.900
What?

00:04:51.900 --> 00:04:53.540
That Yugi is the vessel!

00:04:53.540 --> 00:04:55.570
He's going to fight?

00:04:55.940 --> 00:04:57.610
Dammit!

00:04:57.770 --> 00:04:59.920
He's only a vessel.

00:04:59.920 --> 00:05:06.940
Defeating the vessel doesn't mean I defeated the Pharaoh, so I can't get my revenge!

00:05:11.600 --> 00:05:12.660
It's fine.

00:05:13.040 --> 00:05:18.600
If I pummel the vessel, the Pharaoh will come out of hiding.

00:05:19.200 --> 00:05:23.020
Crush Yugi!  Crush him!

00:05:23.020 --> 00:05:26.000
And pull the Pharaoh out again!

00:05:26.860 --> 00:05:28.140
My turn.

00:05:28.620 --> 00:05:36.770
Partner, there's one card in the deck that may turn Jonouchi back to normal.

00:05:38.080 --> 00:05:40.980
I will draw that card.

00:05:43.600 --> 00:05:45.760
Red-Eyes B. Dragon!

00:05:59.230 --> 00:06:00.260
Oh no!

00:06:00.260 --> 00:06:01.130
Honda?

00:06:03.330 --> 00:06:04.700
I have to fight.

00:06:05.480 --> 00:06:07.580
Shizuka, stay here.

00:06:07.760 --> 00:06:08.280
Okay!

00:06:10.500 --> 00:06:14.480
Give up if you don't want to get hurt.

00:06:15.180 --> 00:06:16.390
You're all talk!

00:06:16.720 --> 00:06:21.320
I can usually defeat three guys, but since I have to protect Shizuka...

00:06:38.280 --> 00:06:40.610
Let me go!

00:06:40.800 --> 00:06:43.200
Don't touch Shizuka!

00:06:44.740 --> 00:06:46.250
Honda!

00:06:46.910 --> 00:06:47.650
Shizuka...

00:06:51.500 --> 00:06:52.120
This is...

00:06:52.310 --> 00:06:55.060
Grownups shouldn't gang up on kids.

00:06:58.200 --> 00:06:59.430
Who are you?

00:06:59.750 --> 00:07:01.530
You're Ryuji Otogi!

00:07:01.680 --> 00:07:03.530
Honda, save the girl!

00:07:06.570 --> 00:07:08.140
We're leaving, Shizuka!

00:07:08.250 --> 00:07:08.770
Okay!

00:07:09.220 --> 00:07:10.720
Who are they?

00:07:10.720 --> 00:07:11.940
We'll talk later!

00:07:12.120 --> 00:07:12.610
Sure.

00:07:12.900 --> 00:07:14.780
Don't let them escape!

00:07:14.780 --> 00:07:15.800
After them!

00:07:23.340 --> 00:07:25.600
Red-Eyes B. Dragon.

00:07:26.070 --> 00:07:31.980
Partner, Jonouchi's heart as a duelist is in that card.

00:07:31.980 --> 00:07:32.700
Yeah.

00:07:33.270 --> 00:07:37.130
Jonouchi and this card have always been fighting together.

00:07:37.750 --> 00:07:39.570
I'll risk it all on this card.

00:07:39.870 --> 00:07:42.170
Crush him!

00:07:42.620 --> 00:07:45.110
Crush him, Jonouchi!

00:07:45.320 --> 00:07:49.670
I'll fight to turn you back to normal.

00:07:49.670 --> 00:07:52.050
And to prove our friendship!

00:07:52.550 --> 00:08:00.420
Red-eyed dragon, I need your soul to awaken the heart of a duelist within Jonouchi!

00:08:00.420 --> 00:08:03.000
C'mon!  What are you doing, Yugi?

00:08:03.000 --> 00:08:04.090
It's your turn!

00:08:04.320 --> 00:08:11.030
I have Kuriboh and Big Shield Gardna with 2600 defense points on my field.

00:08:11.400 --> 00:08:16.470
If I tribute them, I can summon Red-Eyes B. Dragon.

00:08:17.260 --> 00:08:18.140
Partner...

00:08:18.460 --> 00:08:21.080
We only have 1500 life points.

00:08:21.540 --> 00:08:23.480
We must be careful.

00:08:23.480 --> 00:08:24.080
Yeah.

00:08:24.520 --> 00:08:29.280
In this death duel, whoever loses all his life points will die.

00:08:29.280 --> 00:08:33.960
I must save my partner and Jonouchi before the duel ends.

00:08:34.110 --> 00:08:36.940
Hurry up, Yugi!

00:08:37.200 --> 00:08:39.570
I have five cards in my hand.

00:08:40.000 --> 00:08:45.700
Before I summon Red-Eyes this turn, there's something I want to check.

00:08:45.930 --> 00:08:49.650
But if I fail, I may lose my life.

00:08:49.650 --> 00:08:53.080
Yugi, how will you deal with this situation?

00:08:53.470 --> 00:08:55.510
Show me your next move!

00:08:55.510 --> 00:08:58.950
Yugi seems different this turn.

00:08:59.080 --> 00:09:04.260
To turn Jonouchi back to normal, he must've changed to normal Yugi.

00:09:04.530 --> 00:09:08.690
To both Yugis, please return Jonouchi back to normal!

00:09:09.170 --> 00:09:13.630
Remember our bond of friendship, Jonouchi!

00:09:14.080 --> 00:09:16.630
This is the symbol of our friendship.

00:09:17.280 --> 00:09:18.370
What's this?

00:09:18.970 --> 00:09:25.370
The ink will easily wash off, but this ring will always remain in our hearts.

00:09:25.670 --> 00:09:29.370
Our ring of friendship isn't gone!

00:09:29.370 --> 00:09:32.100
Anzu is right.

00:09:32.570 --> 00:09:37.870
That ring of friendship is still in our hearts.

00:09:38.260 --> 00:09:40.190
Even in Jonouchi's heart!

00:09:41.750 --> 00:09:44.860
I believe in Jonouchi!

00:09:46.100 --> 00:09:52.070
My other self, please just watch what I do and don't interfere.

00:09:52.540 --> 00:09:53.800
That card is...

00:09:53.960 --> 00:09:55.440
Here I go!

00:09:55.440 --> 00:09:56.670
Exchange!

00:09:58.350 --> 00:09:59.610
Exchange?

00:10:00.020 --> 00:10:03.200
They exchange one card in their hands.

00:10:03.200 --> 00:10:05.870
Yugi, what are you planning?

00:10:07.920 --> 00:10:11.300
Your hand is so bad that you need to exchange cards?

00:10:11.500 --> 00:10:12.890
Oh well.

00:10:21.670 --> 00:10:23.650
Show me your cards.

00:10:26.450 --> 00:10:28.500
But they're probably all bad-

00:10:36.820 --> 00:10:38.370
Red-Eyes!

00:10:57.700 --> 00:11:04.240
Jonouchi, you can choose and take one of these four cards.

00:11:11.890 --> 00:11:13.050
Partner...

00:11:17.860 --> 00:11:22.660
I knew the vessel was a bad duelist, but I didn't know he was this bad.

00:11:23.020 --> 00:11:25.660
He's willing to give me a rare card.

00:11:27.400 --> 00:11:31.250
Jonouchi, take Red-Eyes!

00:11:32.940 --> 00:11:34.250
Of course.

00:11:34.250 --> 00:11:36.870
This card will make me invulnerable.

00:11:37.030 --> 00:11:39.340
I'll get my Red-Eyes back!

00:11:40.400 --> 00:11:43.130
Jonouchi isn't changing back!

00:11:43.370 --> 00:11:47.110
Even Red-Eyes can't change his heart.

00:12:02.050 --> 00:12:04.740
Why can't I take this card?

00:12:04.740 --> 00:12:05.950
What's wrong?

00:12:05.950 --> 00:12:08.740
Take Red-Eyes B. Dragon, Jonouchi!

00:12:11.460 --> 00:12:12.680
Dammit!

00:12:17.040 --> 00:12:18.280
Jonouchi!

00:12:20.370 --> 00:12:21.480
What?

00:12:22.060 --> 00:12:24.570
You didn't take Red-Eyes?

00:12:24.570 --> 00:12:25.640
Why?

00:12:28.040 --> 00:12:30.880
I don't need monster cards.

00:12:32.050 --> 00:12:37.530
My forbidden cards are enough to kill Yugi!

00:12:37.750 --> 00:12:41.920
I also get to take one card from your hand.

00:12:45.820 --> 00:12:47.240
Jonouchi!

00:12:47.640 --> 00:12:54.420
I now clearly know that you haven't lost the heart of a duelist.

00:12:55.350 --> 00:13:01.120
You promised to duel me in Battle City with our duelists' pride at stake.

00:13:01.120 --> 00:13:06.560
Until that time, you vowed that you wouldn't take your precious Red-Eyes back.

00:13:06.820 --> 00:13:07.950
Be quiet.

00:13:07.950 --> 00:13:12.720
That's why you couldn't take Red-Eyes!

00:13:12.850 --> 00:13:14.640
I said be quiet!

00:13:15.110 --> 00:13:16.640
Stop talking!

00:13:16.640 --> 00:13:23.310
I'm convinced that Red-Eyes will awaken your heart as a duelist.

00:13:24.510 --> 00:13:25.750
Fine, Yugi!

00:13:26.200 --> 00:13:33.350
I'll drop your life points to 0 and drown you in the ocean so that you can never speak again!

00:13:33.620 --> 00:13:35.590
My turn isn't over yet.

00:13:38.170 --> 00:13:41.730
Jonouchi, we're friends forever.

00:13:42.120 --> 00:13:44.650
That's why I'll play this card now!

00:13:44.880 --> 00:13:47.670
I tribute two monsters!

00:13:48.400 --> 00:13:51.240
I summon Red-Eyes B. Dragon!

00:13:58.600 --> 00:14:01.650
Red-Eyes B. Dragon...

00:14:05.850 --> 00:14:10.550
Why didn't you obey me and take Red-Eyes?

00:14:11.020 --> 00:14:13.620
Is my brainwashing weakening?

00:14:14.370 --> 00:14:19.520
Or is Yugi's prattle overcoming my brainwashing?

00:14:19.950 --> 00:14:21.240
Master Marik.

00:14:21.240 --> 00:14:24.240
We failed to capture Yugi's friends.

00:14:24.240 --> 00:14:27.240
Stop reporting every little detail!

00:14:28.440 --> 00:14:30.550
I don't accept failure!

00:14:31.040 --> 00:14:32.680
Capture them!

00:14:38.300 --> 00:14:39.960
Red-Eyes...

00:14:42.500 --> 00:14:46.330
Red-Eyes B. Dragon is almost as strong as my Blue-Eyes.

00:14:46.330 --> 00:14:49.800
That rare card used to belong to Jonouchi.

00:14:49.800 --> 00:14:54.800
Yugi is using Red-Eyes to try to turn Jonouchi back to normal.

00:14:55.170 --> 00:14:57.270
Will it go as planned?

00:14:57.620 --> 00:15:04.650
Jonouchi, you must realize that Red-Eyes's red eyes are full of sorrow.

00:15:05.520 --> 00:15:10.580
Red-Eyes wants you to regain the heart of a duelist.

00:15:10.770 --> 00:15:13.850
That's why we fight!

00:15:14.100 --> 00:15:15.620
Red-Eyes attacks!

00:15:16.120 --> 00:15:17.620
Dark Mega Flare!

00:15:17.880 --> 00:15:20.290
Jonouchi, I believe!

00:15:28.800 --> 00:15:29.900
Jonouchi!

00:15:31.040 --> 00:15:33.100
What are you doing, Jonouchi?

00:15:36.490 --> 00:15:39.450
That attack was nothing special.

00:15:41.400 --> 00:15:47.390
On my next turn, I'll use a forbidden spell card to lower your life points to 0!

00:15:47.840 --> 00:15:50.390
You're done for, Yugi!

00:15:50.800 --> 00:15:53.100
That's right!  Good!

00:15:53.100 --> 00:15:56.360
Crush him!

00:15:57.020 --> 00:16:00.270
Partner, it's too dangerous!  I'm taking over!

00:16:00.380 --> 00:16:01.270
No...

00:16:02.230 --> 00:16:05.160
Let me fight to the end!

00:16:08.760 --> 00:16:09.640
Partner...

00:16:10.040 --> 00:16:13.400
I asked the Millennium Puzzle for a friend.

00:16:13.640 --> 00:16:19.080
And by meeting you inside my heart, you gave me courage.

00:16:19.620 --> 00:16:21.560
I also made special friends.

00:16:22.000 --> 00:16:32.660
But I've always felt that if I never met you, I'd still be a coward.

00:16:33.200 --> 00:16:35.680
That's how I feel.

00:16:35.680 --> 00:16:40.510
That's why I must be the one who turns Jonouchi back to normal!

00:16:40.860 --> 00:16:41.880
Partner...

00:16:42.080 --> 00:16:45.120
So please stay back and watch.

00:16:45.120 --> 00:16:49.220
But a single mistake can end your life in this battle!

00:16:49.540 --> 00:16:50.690
I know.

00:16:51.070 --> 00:16:54.600
But I trust Jonouchi to the end.

00:16:56.700 --> 00:17:01.370
I see.  If you're that determined, I won't try to stop you.

00:17:01.670 --> 00:17:02.600
However...

00:17:03.270 --> 00:17:06.030
Don't die, my other self!

00:17:07.170 --> 00:17:08.970
Thanks, my other self!

00:17:09.420 --> 00:17:14.910
By removing my Millennium Puzzle, my other self can't take over.

00:17:15.600 --> 00:17:18.340
Yugi, stop daydreaming!

00:17:18.630 --> 00:17:22.600
My other self has always protected me.

00:17:22.860 --> 00:17:27.790
But if I don't become stronger, you'll never be able to leave my heart!

00:17:27.790 --> 00:17:31.220
You can keep thinking after you die!

00:17:31.220 --> 00:17:34.160
From this moment, this is my fight!

00:17:34.160 --> 00:17:36.000
Here I go!  It's my turn!

00:17:36.270 --> 00:17:38.460
I don't need any monsters!

00:17:40.720 --> 00:17:42.370
Hinotama!

00:17:42.370 --> 00:17:44.740
I attack you directly!

00:17:49.240 --> 00:17:50.280
Yugi!

00:17:53.900 --> 00:17:55.240
They're not here!

00:17:55.240 --> 00:17:57.580
Damn!  They ran away fast!

00:17:57.580 --> 00:17:59.650
Split up and find them!

00:18:03.180 --> 00:18:05.300
We gave them the slip.

00:18:05.300 --> 00:18:07.090
Let's hide a bit longer.

00:18:07.420 --> 00:18:09.850
Thanks for saving us, Otogi.

00:18:10.370 --> 00:18:16.040
Hey, I thought you were in America for Dungeon Dice Monsters.

00:18:16.270 --> 00:18:20.270
Yeah, but I came back to Japan to take care of a few things.

00:18:20.270 --> 00:18:24.050
That's when I heard about the Battle City Tournament.

00:18:24.050 --> 00:18:27.940
I was hoping to meet Yugi when I got caught up in your mess.

00:18:27.940 --> 00:18:30.040
What's going on?

00:18:30.220 --> 00:18:30.850
Well...

00:18:33.060 --> 00:18:36.640
She's Jonouchi's sister, Shizuka.

00:18:37.520 --> 00:18:39.060
Are you serious?

00:18:39.060 --> 00:18:42.480
Jonouchi has a cute sister?

00:18:42.480 --> 00:18:45.000
I don't want her to hear us.

00:18:45.220 --> 00:18:46.230
Fine.

00:18:47.000 --> 00:18:49.880
Who were those guys?

00:18:49.880 --> 00:18:51.700
Why were they after you?

00:18:51.700 --> 00:18:54.410
They're punks known as the Ghouls.

00:18:54.760 --> 00:18:58.340
They're thieves that steal rare cards from duelists.

00:18:58.340 --> 00:19:02.060
So they're Rare Hunters.

00:19:02.060 --> 00:19:04.350
I've heard about them.

00:19:04.350 --> 00:19:07.020
It seems they're after Yugi.

00:19:07.750 --> 00:19:10.960
But I don't know why they want to capture us.

00:19:11.270 --> 00:19:13.720
We don't have any rare cards.

00:19:14.150 --> 00:19:15.390
Is my brother...

00:19:15.800 --> 00:19:17.910
...in danger?

00:19:17.910 --> 00:19:19.070
Well...

00:19:19.700 --> 00:19:21.730
I can't say no.

00:19:22.230 --> 00:19:26.060
If they're after us, they must be after Anzu and Jonouchi too.

00:19:27.030 --> 00:19:29.040
Hey, what's wrong?

00:19:29.040 --> 00:19:31.340
It's too early to go to sleep.

00:19:33.330 --> 00:19:35.880
Please stop, Jonouchi!

00:19:36.080 --> 00:19:37.770
Kaiba!  Mokuba!

00:19:37.770 --> 00:19:40.120
Don't just stand there!  Stop this!

00:19:40.220 --> 00:19:42.820
But if we make a move, you'll be...

00:19:43.370 --> 00:19:47.190
If he presses that button, the container will fall on Anzu!

00:19:47.370 --> 00:19:48.620
That lowlife!

00:19:50.170 --> 00:19:56.000
I can't bring myself to lower your life points to 0.

00:19:56.440 --> 00:20:00.870
So please do me one favor.

00:20:00.870 --> 00:20:04.700
Silence!  My turn isn't over!

00:20:04.860 --> 00:20:07.100
I summon Rocket Warrior!

00:20:08.960 --> 00:20:14.900
When it attacks your monster, your monster loses 500 attack points until the end of the turn.

00:20:14.900 --> 00:20:16.760
Jonouchi...  I...

00:20:17.200 --> 00:20:19.860
And the spell card Attrition!

00:20:20.200 --> 00:20:22.530
I don't want my precious Puzzle to...

00:20:22.530 --> 00:20:25.350
Here I go!  It's my Battle Phase!

00:20:25.350 --> 00:20:28.070
Rocket Warrior transforms into Invincible Mode!

00:20:28.470 --> 00:20:30.750
Attack Red-Eyes!

00:20:41.550 --> 00:20:44.980
I don't want the Millennium Puzzle to sink into the ocean.

00:20:45.450 --> 00:20:48.770
The Continuous Spell Attrition's effect activates!

00:20:48.770 --> 00:20:52.310
It loses attack points equal to the damage we took!

00:20:54.510 --> 00:20:55.710
How's that?

00:21:01.850 --> 00:21:04.040
Therefore, I want you...

00:21:10.250 --> 00:21:12.000
It hurts!

00:21:12.000 --> 00:21:14.210
What's this pain?

00:21:15.750 --> 00:21:16.980
Jonouchi...

00:21:18.930 --> 00:21:23.160
I want you to hold on to the Millennium Puzzle...

00:21:25.330 --> 00:21:27.550
...in my place.

00:21:41.460 --> 00:21:47.410
Jonouchi tries to throw the Millennium Puzzle into the ocean, but he stops!

00:21:47.410 --> 00:21:50.570
Marik's brainwashing must be weakening!

00:21:50.570 --> 00:21:54.080
Marik is annoyed that Jonouchi isn't obeying his orders.

00:21:54.080 --> 00:21:58.480
But the time bomb is reaching the time limit!

00:21:58.480 --> 00:22:03.240
If the duel doesn't end before then, they'll both sink into the ocean!

00:22:03.550 --> 00:22:06.260
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
Countdown to Despair

00:22:06.260 --> 00:22:07.860
Duel, standby!

00:22:22.900 --> 00:22:27.400
Even a long, long time ago

00:22:28.200 --> 00:22:32.770
I feel like I've been here

00:22:33.300 --> 00:22:42.430
The setting sun colors the classroom after school

00:22:42.740 --> 00:22:53.940
We all laugh as you point out that I cut my bangs too short

00:22:56.830 --> 00:23:01.440
Time passes bit by bit

00:23:02.130 --> 00:23:06.740
The time when my bangs touch my eyelids

00:23:07.300 --> 00:23:11.820
Will never change

00:23:12.510 --> 00:23:17.090
The sunset envelops everyone

00:23:17.750 --> 00:23:22.320
To be who I am

00:23:22.920 --> 00:23:27.560
I've kept searching for something

00:23:28.220 --> 00:23:32.240
The time that we're now spending together

00:23:32.240 --> 00:23:35.200
I learned that's the answer

00:23:36.000 --> 00:23:42.310
From now until forever...
